# PHASE 12 — Store historical health data

This is important.

Instead of collecting data and throwing it away, save it.

Create:

```sql
CREATE TABLE dba_ai.health_history
(
    id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    collected_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),

    database_name TEXT,

    connections INTEGER,

    database_size_bytes BIGINT,

    long_running_queries INTEGER,

    blocking_sessions INTEGER,

    xid_age BIGINT,

    cache_hit_ratio NUMERIC,

    status TEXT
);
```

Then Python:

```python
def save_health(metrics):

    query = """
    INSERT INTO dba_ai.health_history
    (
        database_name,
        connections,
        database_size_bytes,
        long_running_queries,
        blocking_sessions,
        xid_age
    )
    VALUES
    (
        %s,
        %s,
        %s,
        %s,
        %s,
        %s
    );
    """

    with get_connection() as conn:

        with conn.cursor() as cur:

            cur.execute(
                query,
                (
                    metrics["database"],
                    metrics["connections"],
                    metrics["database_size_bytes"],
                    metrics["long_running_queries"],
                    metrics["blocking_sessions"],
                    metrics["xid_age"]
                )
            )

        conn.commit()
```

Now you can build:

```text
Database growth graph
Connections graph
XID age graph
Blocking sessions graph
```

